Z||000000||fierodude||07-01-2001||05:37 PM||||as ive posted before i got an 86se thats been sitting since 1997,it started in the winter but now the fuel pump dosen't sound,now i got all the electrical checked it seems to be fine but the service engine light dosen't come on, any similar experiences?,how can i get the car running?<P>------------------<BR>slice the rice! it dosen't pay to drive jap - crap!||||reg||1
Z||000001||PBJ||07-01-2001||08:05 PM||||The ses light does not come on.  Now that tells me that the ecm does not have power-look into this befor you drop the tank for the fuel pump.   Do you have a manual schematic of some type?||||reg||1
